{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜微軟服務全球故障 金管局稱港零售銀行關鍵系統運作正常 籲市民防騙           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left tight-spacing neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">微軟（Microsoft，美：MSFT）全球服務故障，周五（13日）電郵、文件存取及系統提交受阻。金管局表示，知悉微軟部分服務在全球多地發生故障，正密切留意情況及對銀行服務的潛在影響，目前香港所有零售銀行的關鍵系統，包括存款及轉帳，維持正常運作。金管局又提醒市民提防騙徒藉事件訛稱提供技術支援，騙取帳戶登入資料，切勿點擊來歷不明的超連結或透露支付卡資料、密碼及一次性密碼。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T15:23:35.596993+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T14:00:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T15:17:01.339379+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T15:17:01.339379+00:00","content_hash":"6f5920bc42a38f1b1b51fbc1b2b7d7527cb35c8bb78b22a2b23eb9ace60917aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}